    "title": "XPEV Stock Falls On $500M AI Bet For Self-Driving Tech — Exec Says Xpeng Is Following Google’s Pixel Playbook",
    "byline": null,
    "published_at": null,
    "site_name": "finance.yahoo.com",
    "language": null
